# 予定表 (design 11.10), for tools/ui_run.py: the template opened, and 2026/10
# chosen in the panel that asks for a year and a month (the window opens on
# today's month, and the cells below are those of 2026/10, whatever day the
# test runs on); three days' plans made (a rectangle pulled out in a cell, a
# double press), one opened and closed (its view written back into the link,
# by the program, DT_F_LINK), the next month and back, closed and opened again
open 019d6f00-1a2b-7c3d-8e4f-a1b2c3d4e5f6
expect calendar: ready
wait 800
win 予定表
click 425 148
wait 500
text 202610
key 28
expect calendar: month 2026/10 links
wait 500
shot cal_month
drag 240 300 300 350
expect calendar: made day 2026/10/05
drag 240 395 300 440
expect calendar: made day 2026/10/12
dclick 600 430
expect calendar: made day 2026/10/15
drag 250 330 310 360
expect calendar: opened 2026/10/05
wait 800
shot cal_events_opened
key 08 01
expect calendar: link view written back: 0,0
wait 500
click 300 148
expect calendar: month 2026/11
wait 300
shot cal_next
click 160 148
expect calendar: month 2026/10 links 3
wait 300
shot cal_events
click 160 690
key 08 01
expect calendar: closed
logmark
open 019d6f00-1a2b-7c3d-8e4f-a1b2c3d4e5f6
expectsince calendar: ready
wait 800
click 425 148
wait 500
text 202610
key 28
expectsince calendar: month 2026/10 links 3
wait 800
shot cal_reopened
# a link of 仮身サンプル dropped on a cell, the plans of 2026/10/15 taken out
open 019a4370-3819-79a2-9758-881e1e0de90a
wait 1000
drag 400 414 850 250
expect calendar: dropped 1
# the keys went to 予定表 with the drop (design 10.4): the text is pressed before it is closed
click 1000 148
wait 2000
key 08 01
wait 500
wait 300
click 630 399
key 4C
expect calendar: deleted 2026/10/15
wait 300
shot cal_dropped
# the panel that asks for a year and a month
click 425 148
wait 500
shot cal_ask_month
key 29
wait 300
# nothing it did was refused for want of a right
absent !OACV!
